QMMF SDK comes with inline code documentation and workflow diagrams.
This documentation provides the QTI Multimedia Framework (QMMF)
software development kit (SDK) user guide and API reference guide.


To generate this documentation follow the steps.

1. Install doxygen (if you don't have it already)
sudo apt-get install doxygen

2. Run
doxygen doxy_qmmf_conf
in docs/Doxygen

3. This will generate additional directory
doxygen with html folder in it. Inside the folder
open index.html and you are ready.
